<title>USA: USCI to sell pagers through Walgreen stores.</title>
<headline>USCI to sell pagers through Walgreen stores.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>USCI Inc said Thursday its Ameritel Communications Inc unit agreed with Walgreen Co to sell one-way paging services nationally through all 2,450 Walgreen retail locations.</p>
<p>USCI will install specialized point-of-purchase centers in all stores. Paging sales will begin in August and the projected roll-out of the retail locations will be completed by early fall.</p>
</text>
